OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will be possible tonight, with
OL,7,Fclearer spells developing towards
OL,8,Fdawn, allowing temperatures to dip
OL,9,Fwith a touch of frost. Strong
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds towards the coast
OL,11,Fat first add to the chill.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FPatchy light rain may linger
OL,14,Fat first, with sunny spells developing
OL,15,Finto the afternoon, though feeling
OL,16,Fchilly under northerly winds. Though
OL,17,Fturning wet and windy into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
