OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FRemaining chilly and rather damp. Rain
OL,7,Fpersists on Tuesday, turning heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes with snow over the hills. Rain
OL,9,Freturns on Wednesday before turning
OL,10,Fdrier into Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
